  _globals['_IMAGEUPLOADSERVICE'].methods_by_name['FinishImageUpload']._serialized_options = b'\222A\272\003\n\006Images\022!Finalize a completed image upload\032\252\002Validates that all parts are uploaded contiguously (1..N) and total size matches declared `size_bytes`. Completes the multipart upload and marks the session COMPLETE.\n\nReturns `object_id` \342\200\224 the permanent reference to the uploaded image file. If already COMPLETE, returns the existing `object_id`.*\021FinishImageUploadJ;\n\003200\0224\n\002OK\022.\n,\032*.firebird.api.v1.FinishImageUploadResponseb\020\n\016\n\nBearerAuth\022\000\202\323\344\223\0021\",/compute/images/uploads/{upload_id}/complete:\001*'
